Nope, you can still bite it after that.  A few more things I find
nearly essential to finish the game without a lot of trouble:

1) some reliable method of levitation (for ludios, castle, medusa,
endgame, etc.); 

2) bag of holding (unless you don't mind all your
potions/scrolls/spellbooks burning up eventually, or don't carry very
much and then you can do with just a sack);

3) tinning kit (to max out your strength and gain intrinsics easily);

4) helm of opposite alignment if you are not chaotic (to avoid spending
hours in Gehennom once you have the Amulet);

5) unicorn horn (but these shouldn't be too hard to come up with);

6) luckstone (also easy to find);

7) buckets o' holy water.

Above should all be blessed, of course.

I also like to have several scrolls of gold detection for the endgame,
and a cursed unicorn horn to produce confusion (although there are more
efficient methods).  I'm sure I carry a lot more of other things than I
should, but the above I consider essential.  I DON'T consider a wand of
polymorph essential, but it is very useful.

